              are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fibers"} homotopy fibers
              and as such coincide with the ordinary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact-open+topology"} mapping space
              between the fibers (by
              = succeed "):" do
                %a{:href => "parameterized+homotopy+theory#FiberOfFiberwiseMappingSpace"} this Example
